OL,3,GNEWSASEND school facility built in
OL,4,A#3.6m council project
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe building of a new education
OL,7,Ffacility for Special Educational Needs
OL,8,Fand Disabilities (SEND) students in
OL,9,FSurrey has been completed.
OL,11,FBuilt at St John the Baptist School in
OL,12,FWoking, The Aquinas Centre is a #3.6m
OL,13,Fproject under Surrey County Council's
OL,14,FInclusion and Additional Needs
OL,15,FPartnership Strategy to help children
OL,16,Fand young people access the right
OL,17,Fsupport.
OL,19,FThe site will initially welcome six
OL,20,FYear 7 pupils in September before
OL,21,Fexpanding to provide 30 specialist
OL,22,Fplaces.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
