OL,3,GNEWSASEND school facility built in
OL,4,A#3.6m council project
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillor Helyn Clack said: "This
OL,7,Finvestment reflects our commitment to
OL,8,Fproviding inclusive education
OL,9,Fopportunities that enable every child
OL,10,Fto thrive within their local
OL,11,Fcommunity."
